 - 2026-06-02: Acquire a small structured-reasoning TRAIN corpus (GSM8K via HF datasets), shrink EBT to ~10-50M params, and smoke a SINGLE real training step on the 3090 confirming the model fits in 24GB and the energy/loss DECREASES. THESIS-A bring-up step 2. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: tiny_ebt_38M_fits_3090_1283mb_single_train_step_loss_finite_and_decreasing_corpus_gsm8k_n2048; results/experiment_3726_tiny_ebt_corpus_and_train_step_smoke.json
 - 2026-06-02: Bounded CHECKPOINTED training of the tiny EBT + a matched tiny AR baseline (same params-band, same corpus, same budget) on the 3090, with stability diagnostics (loss curve, convergence, NaN/divergence watch). Each task run trains a BOUNDED chunk (<=1500s wall) then checkpoints + exits so it fits the loop; resumes from checkpoint. THESIS-A bring-up step 4 (the GPU-budget half of the kill-gate). (⚠️ Blocked) — honest_verdict=blocked_ebt; results/experiment_3728_bounded_checkpointed_train_ebt_and_ar.json
